{
  "overrides": [
    {
      "pattern": "\\b(?:protein|energy|granola)\\s*bars?\\b|\\bbarebells\\b|\\bspindrift\\b|\\breese(?:s)?\\b|\\bspaghetti\\s+squash\\b|땅콩샌드|카라멜|사발면|사발|과자|스낵|비누|세제|\\bturkey\\s+bacon\\b"
    },
